        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS have the pleasure of representing this impressive 4 bed detached bungalow on a generous site of c. 0.19 hectares / c. 0.46 acres TO BE SOLD WITH SITE in the lovely village of Kill, Co. Kildare.\n\n' Hartwell Lower' is set in a quiet and established area just minutes from Naas and within easy reach of Dublin via the N7. With it's bright, well-proportioned interiors, mature gardens and excellent local amenities, this property presents a rare opportunity to acquire a stunning bungalow in one of Kildare's most desirable locations with a site for versatile use. Kill Village is a vibrant and welcoming community known for its historic charm, excellent amenities, and easy access to Dublin and Naas. The village offers a peaceful, family-friendly atmosphere with local shops, cafés, schools, and sporting clubs all within walking distance. Surrounded by green countryside and scenic walks, Kill combines the comfort of rural living with superb connectivity, making it one of Kildare's most appealing and convenient places to call home.\n\nBright & spacious interior living accommodation of c. 128 sq m compromises of a grand entrance hallway with living room, dining room, kitchen, utility room, storage space and the main family bathroom to the right and centre. With four spacious bedrooms to the left hand side with a master ensuite. The private gated entrance provides security and a grand approach upon the property. The wrap around garden offers sunlight throughout the day, excellent outdoor versatility and ample parking.\n\n'Hartwell Lower' comes to the market in excellent condition throughout having been lovingly maintained by its current owners with the highest quality of fixtures & fittings available in this home. It has plenty of additional features to include a C1 BER, Oil heating, a generous wrap around garden and plot size of c. 0.19 hectares / c. 0.46 acres, a site for versatile use, 1 level property and a private gated entrance.\n\nEarly viewing is highly advised! Call RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS on 01 459 9288..\n\nFeatures:\n<ul>\n <li>128 sq m</li>\n <li>C1 BER rating</li>\n <li>4 BED 2 BATH</li>\n <li>Detached Bungalow</li>\n <li>Oil heating</li>\n <li>Property on a plot of c .0.19 hectares / 0.46 acres</li>\n <li>Sold with neighbouring site</li>\n <li>Enviable location in the heart of Kill</li>\n <li>Mature gardens to the front & rear</li>\n <li>A fantastic opportunity for a selection of buyers!</li>\n <li>Enquire now!!</li>\n</ul>\n\nDirections:\nEircode: W91EK5X. From Kill Main Street, go past the Eurospar and take a turn down Hartwell Road. At the Y junction take the left road and the property will  be on the left hand side."
      },
